Update project to use Java 21 (LTS) across all build configurations:
- Set java.version to 21 in pom.xml
- Set languageVersion to 21 in build.gradle
- Update CI/CD workflows (maven-build.yml, gradle-build.yml)
- Update DevContainer Dockerfile for Java 21
- Update README.md documentation

Java 21 is the latest LTS release (September 2023) with:
- Virtual Threads (Project Loom)
- Pattern Matching improvements
- Record Patterns
- Sequenced Collections

All tests pass (58 tests, 0 failures).

